skip-flashmla) with ZERO fuzz and ZERO offset. Content is byte-identical to
the -v0.5.21 variant apart from the hunk line numbers (+1 everywhere below the
new "Torch 2.14 headers reject anything below C++20" comment that v0.5.23 added
above SGL_KERNEL_CXX_STANDARD, now "20"). The sgl-kernel tree did NOT move:
still python/sglang/kernels/aot (SGL_KERNEL_DIR), package sglang-kernel 0.4.10.
The -v0.5.21 set still applies at offset 1 (silent), so the suffix is
